  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Heat a large frying pan over medium-high heat with enough olive oil to coat the base.\n• Cook plant-based crumbed chicken until golden and heated through, 2-3 minutes on each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86ee14264524ca979fa5b/step-b44fa400.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat. Cook katsu paste and coconut milk, stirring, until combined and heated through, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86ee14264524ca979fa5b/step-524e0b10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, microwave basmati rice until steaming, 2-3 minutes.\n• Trim and halve pea pods lengthways.\n• In a large bowl, combine deluxe salad mix, pea pods and Japanese style dressing. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86ee14264524ca979fa5b/step-221bbf20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide instant rice and rainbow salad between bowls. Top with crumbed chick'n.\n• Spoon over golden curry sauce. Sprinkle with crispy shallots to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f86ee14264524ca979fa5b/step-4cea4b30.jpg"
    }
  ]
